  "description": "The G4.WebDriver package seamlessly integrates with WebDriver backends through the WebDriver protocol, offering a powerful and extensible framework for web automation and testing. While designed for compatibility with the G4™ ecosystem, this package can be employed independently in any .NET project, providing a standardized interface for controlling web browsers remotely. Utilize the feature-rich RemoteWebDriver class to streamline web automation tasks, ensuring compatibility and interoperability across diverse environments.",
